{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are being watched. You are being tested.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/extras/f387fd64b9733ee136789e3374c0d49c.poster.avif?t=1769549550\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/extras/f387fd64b9733ee136789e3374c0d49c.webm?t=1769549550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/extras/f387fd64b9733ee136789e3374c0d49c.mp4?t=1769549550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>RAVENRIDGE</i>, step into the decaying halls of a forgotten prison turned secret facility. Play as Ethan Ward, a troubled private investigator drawn to the ruins of Ravenridge Penitentiary in search of a missing federal agent\u2014and haunted echoes of his own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a high-security prison, Ravenridge was shut down in 1994 after a supposed riot. But the truth was buried. Behind its sealed doors, the Promethix Research Group continued its experiments: breaking minds, erasing memories, and reprogramming identity\u2014all in the name of obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ethan delves deeper, surveillance intensifies, reality fractures, and strange figures begin to emerge from the shadows\u2014watching, always watching. Each floor brings new psychological trials, cryptic messages, and traces of Ethan\u2019s father, a doctor who vanished here decades ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is running the experiment now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the subject\u2014or the observer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you shut it all down\u2026 or ensure it never ends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAVENRIDGE is a psychological horror experience where every choice leaves a trace\u2014on the system, and on you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734540?t=1769549550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734540?t=1769549550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/a5590b464fff6813655a63908d792428922e4147/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769549550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/a5590b464fff6813655a63908d792428922e4147/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769549550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"With the psychological horror elements in the game, you are likely to see corpses and blood in the game and there are"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3745620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are being watched. You are being tested.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/extras/f387fd64b9733ee136789e3374c0d49c.poster.avif?t=1769549550\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/extras/f387fd64b9733ee136789e3374c0d49c.webm?t=1769549550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/extras/f387fd64b9733ee136789e3374c0d49c.mp4?t=1769549550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>RAVENRIDGE</i>, step into the decaying halls of a forgotten prison turned secret facility. Play as Ethan Ward, a troubled private investigator drawn to the ruins of Ravenridge Penitentiary in search of a missing federal agent\u2014and haunted echoes of his own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a high-security prison, Ravenridge was shut down in 1994 after a supposed riot. But the truth was buried. Behind its sealed doors, the Promethix Research Group continued its experiments: breaking minds, erasing memories, and reprogramming identity\u2014all in the name of obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ethan delves deeper, surveillance intensifies, reality fractures, and strange figures begin to emerge from the shadows\u2014watching, always watching. Each floor brings new psychological trials, cryptic messages, and traces of Ethan\u2019s father, a doctor who vanished here decades ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is running the experiment now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the subject\u2014or the observer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you shut it all down\u2026 or ensure it never ends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAVENRIDGE is a psychological horror experience where every choice leaves a trace\u2014on the system, and on you.</strong></p>","developers":["NextHaven Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734540/3d73b5248da0ad2e6aeb03e56b96e7492938f703/header.jpg?t=1769549550","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"RAVENRIDGE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</st